    {
      "contact_id": "agxzfnViZXItdm9pY2VyFAsSB0NvbnRhY3QYgMDCra6wmgoM",
      "content": "I didn't know, I didn't know how to answer that question. It is definitely not going to be the same as a house of this size, that's full of furniture. So I just put, we're taking some things. Technically, when your folks arrive, it'll be a hundred percent of what's remaining but I will have also gotten rid of about half the items in the house so whichever way you'd like to, whichever way you'd like to flag that.",
