    {
      "contact_id": "agxzfnViZXItdm9pY2VyFAsSB0NvbnRhY3QYgMDCra6wmgoM",
      "content": "I suppose I could give you a list, but I'm assuming there has to be a faster way. So what's the best way to tell you, like, I, if I just say assume it's a 2000 square foot home, and you're taking everything then yes, it's just, it's not, I don't, I don't know if it matters for how you guys do this. It's just the house won't be full at the time that your folks arrive to move it.",
