      "type": "transcript",
      "user_id": "4886812291923968"
    },
    {
      "content": "Okay, well basically I wasn't. What I'm trying to figure out is how much, how many movers we need and how many trucks we need to send, but basically, we just charge by the hour and the hour rate is $109 per hour per mover. Although, you know, that hour rate includes everything, the gas, the truck taxes and insurance, we will also bring our own tools for any disassemble or reassembly for the furniture or even appliances and we're of course gonna wrap up the furniture and moving blankets, insurance wraps. So they are protected while they are being moved.",
      "name": "Jules Nicolas",
